 and is free and open to the public. “The exhibition is a celebration of 
 our Elected Members’ talents and individual artistic journeys. CAS is de
 lighted to showcase their art in this special show\,” said Robin-Hammeal
 -Urban\, CAS President.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/elected-memb
 ers-exhibition
